\c 2
\p 
\v 1 [I lifted up]{strong=“H5375” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w mine eyes| strong="H5869" \w* [again, and looked]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w and behold a man| strong="H376" \w* \w with a measuring| strong="H4060" \w* \w line| strong="H2256" \w* \w in his hand| strong="H3027" \w*. 
