\p
\v 16 These are \w the things| strong="H1697" \w* [that ye shall do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}; [Speak]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8761”} \w ye every man| strong="H376" \w* \w the truth| strong="H571" \w* \w to his neighbour| strong="H7453" \w*; [execute]{strong=“H8199” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w the judgment| strong="H4941" \w* \w of truth| strong="H571" \w* \w and peace| strong="H7965" \w* \w in your gates| strong="H8179" \w*:\f + \fr 8:16 \ft execute…: Heb. judge truth, and the judgment of peace \f* 
\v 17 \w And let none| strong="H376" \w* [of you imagine]{strong=“H2803” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w evil| strong="H7451" \w* \w in your hearts| strong="H3824" \w* \w against his neighbour| strong="H7453" \w*; [and love]{strong=“H157” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w no false| strong="H8267" \w* \w oath| strong="H7621" \w*: for all these are things [that I hate]{strong=“H8130” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [saith]{strong=“H5002” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} the \sc Lord\sc*. 
\p
\v 18 \w And the word| strong="H1697" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w* [came unto me, saying]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, 
