\v 22 [Yea, many]{strong=“H7227”} \w people| strong="H5971" \w* \w and strong| strong="H6099" \w* \w nations| strong="H1471" \w* [shall come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [to seek]{strong=“H1245” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} the \sc Lord\sc* \w of hosts| strong="H6635" \w* \w in Jerusalem| strong="H3389" \w*, [and to pray]{strong=“H2470” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} \w before| strong="H6440" \w* the \sc Lord\sc*.\f + \fr 8:22 \ft to pray…: Heb. to intreat the face of \f* 
